NOTES
=====
This is a BACKUP / ALTERNATIVE solution for the ICASSP 2027 Audio Editing
Challenge (AEC). It is NOT the official submission. The official submission
belongs to the project "jxzhen/aec-2027-editx-lora" which uses
Step-Audio-EditX + LoRA on a different track. This repository exists only as
a comparison / contrast / fail-safe artifact and is not intended to be
confused with the official entry.

The upstream models referenced by the Agent router (microsoft/VibeVoice-ASR,
openbmb/MiniCPM-o-2_6) are governed by their own respective licenses. Please
review those licenses before redistribution.